## Context

Child of tracker `0648`. No current acceptance assertion drives R15's primary
event: an indexed item moving into Zotero's trash. README says goal 2 asserts
this, but no bench or test source performs the event.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] add the smallest target-neutral trash-item fixture mutation
- [ ] seed a unique sentinel and prove it searchable before trashing
- [ ] trashing, not empty-trash or maintenance, starts the assertion
- [ ] wait under R35's owned bound and inspect query results plus every
      applicable store and queue named in `SPEC.md §5.2.7`
- [ ] decompress compressed slabs before byte-level inspection
- [ ] prove pause cannot gate removal and queued work cannot resurrect text
- [ ] red controls cover query-only removal, queue survival and slab survival
- [ ] register the assertion and produce a real zoteus verdict
- [ ] `make check` passes
